    "top_reviews": [
      {
        "id": "R10LXHKQUDCMCQ",
        "title": "Just like the name brand",
        "body": "I always keep a pack of Amazon Basics Cotton Swabs on hand, and they’ve quickly become a household staple. The cotton tips are soft yet firm enough to use for a variety of things — from personal hygiene to cleaning small nooks around the house.I love that they’re sturdy and don’t fall apart when you’re using them, and the amount you get in a pack is great value. They’re simple, reliable, and exactly what you expect from basic cotton swabs — just good quality without paying extra.Perfect for everyday use in bathrooms, first‑aid kits, or travel!",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": {
