      },
      {
        "id": "RXW7VXQN51RBR",
        "title": "Best Money Saver on Cotton Swabs – Way Cheaper Than Dollar Tree/99 Cent Store!",
        "body": "If you go through cotton swabs regularly (ears, baby care, crafts, cleaning small spots), grab this Amazon Basics 500-count pack—it's a no-brainer for saving money. For around $4–$5 (often on sale), you get 500 sturdy, soft-tipped swabs that do the job just as well as Q-tips or store brands.At the Dollar Tree or 99 Cent Store, you're lucky to get 100 for $1–$1.25—meaning you'd pay 5x more for the same amount here. These are thicker, hold together better (no loose cotton falling off), and feel premium without the premium price. Great for everyday use, gentle on skin/babies, and the box lasts forever.No complaints on quality—I've switched permanently from the tiny dollar-store packs. If you want to save cash and still get reliable swabs, this is the way to go. Highly recommend stocking up!",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": {
          "raw": "Reviewed in the United States on February 9, 2026"
        },
