        "link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/customer-reviews/RXW7VXQN51RBR/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?ie=UTF8"
      },
      {
        "id": "R1Y2R3ESXEX7DP",
        "title": "Perfect for Everyday Use!",
        "body": "I’ve been using Amazon Basics Cotton Swabs for a while now, and they never disappoint! The cotton tips are soft yet sturdy, and they don’t unravel like some other brands. The sticks are strong and flexible enough for all kinds of tasks—cleaning small spaces, applying skincare, or touch-ups. The packaging is convenient and keeps them clean and organized.Great quality at such an affordable price. Highly recommend!",
        "rating": 5,
