      },
      {
        "id": "RKU68TN13XQFL",
        "title": "practical, functional and budget friendly",
        "body": "These are basic white Q-tips. Most hold up well and won’t bend easily with slight pressure, though a few may flex if too much pressure is applied (which you shouldn’t do in the ear anyway). The tips aren’t as soft as some name brands but are still soft enough for safe use.Overall, they are a great value for the money.Pros:Affordable and good valueMost Q-tips are sturdy and hold their shapeSoft enough for everyday useCons:Some tips may bend under pressureNot as soft as premium brandsConclusion:Overall, these Q-tips are practical, functional, and budget-friendly. They work well for everyday use, though a few may bend if handled roughly.",
