      {
        "id": "R1JFEG58K53JC5",
        "title": "I couldn't be happier with my choice!",
        "body": "This 500-count pack is perfect for personal hygiene and baby care. The quality is excellent; the cotton tips are soft and absorbent, making them gentle on the skin. They’re versatile, too—I use them for everything from cleaning to makeup application. The packaging is convenient, allowing easy access while keeping the swabs clean. It's a fantastic value for the price. I highly recommend these cotton swabs to anyone looking for reliable and high-quality personal care items!",
