      {
        "id": "R2455U070P7P1X",
        "title": "Soft, Sturdy, and a Great Value for Everyday Use",
        "body": "These Amazon Basics cotton swabs are exactly what you’d want for everyday use. The tips are soft and well-formed, and they don’t feel flimsy or loosely wrapped. They hold together well without unraveling, which makes them much easier to use.The sticks themselves are sturdy enough that they don’t bend immediately with light pressure, but they’re still flexible enough to be comfortable. I’ve used them for basic hygiene, small clean-ups, and general household tasks, and they perform just like you’d expect.The 500-count pack is also a great value. It lasts a long time and makes it easy to keep extras in the bathroom or first aid kit without running out quickly.Overall, these are simple, dependable cotton swabs that get the job done. Affordable, consistent quality, and perfect for everyday needs.",
